Sample MP4 files are not stored in this repository (keeps AMP/git clones fast).

When you need them for local clients, functional tests, or the demo UI:

  bash scripts/misc/fetch_sample_assets.sh

Expected files after fetch (gitignored, local only):
  - assets/sample_video.mp4
  - assets/sample_video_streamable.mp4

Or pass your own video with --input-mp4 on any client.
